The '''Dathomir system''' was a [[star system]] within the [[Quelii sector]], a [[sector]]<ref name="USW" /> inside the [[Outer Rim Territories]]<ref name="Region note" /> of [[the galaxy]].<ref name="USW" /> The star system contained the [[planet]] [[Dathomir]], home of the [[Nightsisters]].<ref name="SWEDathomir" />

